This is a Frappe app, so it runs inside a **bench**. It cannot run standalone.

## Setup
```sh
bench get-app https://github.com/Tacten/biograph
bench --site <site> install-app healthcare
```
CI bootstraps a bench with `.github/helper/install.sh`.

## Tests
```sh
cd ~/frappe-bench && bench --site test_site run-parallel-tests --app healthcare
# single module (standard Frappe):
bench --site test_site run-tests --app healthcare --module healthcare.healthcare.doctype.patient_appointment.test_patient_appointment
```

## Lint and format
```sh
pip install pre-commit && pre-commit install
npm install   # eslint deps
pre-commit run --all-files   # ruff, ruff-format, prettier, eslint, pip-audit, detect-secrets, yaml/json/toml/ast checks
```

Semgrep, as run in CI:
```sh
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/frappe/semgrep-rules.git .frappe-semgrep-rules
pip install semgrep
semgrep ci --config ./.frappe-semgrep-rules/rules --config r/python.lang.correctness
```

## Patient portal
```sh
yarn install          # root postinstall installs patient_portal too
yarn build            # = cd patient_portal && vite build --base=/assets/healthcare/patient_portal/
cd patient_portal && yarn dev   # vite dev server with frappe proxy
```

## Migrations
```sh
bench --site <site> migrate   # runs healthcare/patches.txt
```
